/strong><br>Figure out cryptic clues, search the scene and work out what actually needs fixing, with dynamic solutions that mean jobs can change each time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A playful 3D world full of shareable moments</strong><br>Explore six packed locations with <strong>100+ secrets, 200+ ambient stories and 45 hilarious photo opportunities</strong> waiting to be discovered and shared.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow your business one job at a time</strong><br>Earn money and reputation from successful jobs, upgrade and customise your rifle, unlock costumes and collectibles, decorate your office hub and expand your operation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected problems. Serious precision. Zero violence</strong><br>Fix signs, tighten bolts, pop balloons and jump-start fireworks. Nobody gets hurt. Ever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Sniper Dan is an outrageously funny, family-friendly 3D Hidden Object game with a big twist. Use a sniper rifle to solve hundreds of low-stakes jobs across six packed locations, discover surprising secrets, snap hilarious photo ops, and unlock costumes, upgrades, office décor, collectables and more!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841650/9eea1ad77a3e0e9c474a24d867a72a03b71d4dd6/header.jpg?t=1787759581", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841650/b5b1259672a1b72ff36c11029e260992990a6723/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787759581", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841650/b5b1259672a1b72ff36c11029e260992990a6723/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787759581", "website": "https://pqube.co.uk/games/sniper-dan/", "p